## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/idtorgb.html
- Summary (EN): Converts an ID layer, VDB or attribute into an RGB layer, VDB or attribute by using the ID value as a seed for a random number generator, giving each ID its own color.
- Résumé (FR) : Attribue une couleur à chaque identifiant en utilisant sa valeur comme graine d'un générateur aléatoire.

- Inputs meaning: ["id: the ID layer, VDB or attribute to convert"]

- Key parameters: [{"name": "Seed", "meaning": "seed for the random number generator; changing it produces new random colors"}]

- Caveats: ["The page does not say how colors are distributed, or whether the same ID always yields the same color across seeds."]

